  "name": "Example: Calculating the Magnitude of a Vector Given in Component Form",
  "problem": "Let $\\mathbf{a}=\\langle 2, -3, -7 \\rangle$. Find $|\\mathbf{a}|$.",
  "worked_solution": "Using the formula, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\,| & =\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-3)^{2}+(-7)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+9+49} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{62}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
